			<item>
				<title>Install from live session</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/docs/installation-guide/install-from-live-session/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:11:03 -0700</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/installation-guide/install-from-live-session/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With your &lt;strong&gt;liveboot USB&lt;/strong&gt; set up, you can prepare to boot into a &lt;strong&gt;live session&lt;/strong&gt; of Linux Mint.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;First, you need to set your computer system to recognize that it should boot from a different device at startup (your &lt;strong&gt;Ventoy&lt;/strong&gt; device). This option is changed in your computer’s &lt;code&gt;BIOS MENU&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;book-tabs&#34; &gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;input type=&#34;radio&#34; class=&#34;toggle&#34; name=&#34;tabs-&amp;lt;nil&amp;gt;&#34; id=&#34;tabs-&amp;lt;nil&amp;gt;-0&#34; checked=&#34;checked&#34; /&gt;&lt;label for=&#34;tabs-&amp;lt;nil&amp;gt;-0&#34;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;book-tabs-content markdown-inner&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;disable-secure-boot-in-bios-menu&#34;&gt;Disable secure boot in &lt;code&gt;BIOS MENU&lt;/code&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#disable-secure-boot-in-bios-menu&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Reboot your computer with the &lt;strong&gt;Ventoy USB&lt;/strong&gt; still inserted.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Before the computer can fully boot, enter the &lt;code&gt;BIOS MENU&lt;/code&gt; by pressing the required special key.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
